{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: #c91623;\">■</span> 本文来源：新华网</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">李顺欢、李顺星是京东物流广州越秀珠光营业部的快递亲兄弟，弟弟李顺星认为做快递就是做好服务，好服务在于细节。<span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><strong>兄弟俩有个共同的愿望：两人要一起把快递工作干下去</strong></span>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/16248/28/20687/250567/63cf3dc9F7920999b/bbddbaf63c849857.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">弟弟李顺星表示，整个珠光站点有三分之二的人都是他的徒弟，有些工龄也超过五年了。&ldquo;刚开始的时候就教他们送货小心一点，有时候上楼看好自己的货物，还要教他们怎么跟客户沟通，更好地揽收包裹。&rdquo;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><strong>今年春节兄弟俩都不回家了，让有需要的同事先回去，他们可以过完年再回去看妈妈</strong></span>。李顺星说：&ldquo;过年的时候一个人要跑几个地方，变得更忙了，但我们也要第一时间把快递送到顾客手上。&rdquo;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">说起新年愿望，<span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><strong>李顺欢说想把老家的房子盖了，弟弟李顺星则希望妈妈身体好一点，明年在揽收方面的业务可以更上一层楼</strong></span>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">&mdash;&mdash;<img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/120134/7/18392/855/63cf3e23F0cd71213/e10adee7429a1999.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" /> 初二&middot;好服务&middot;享生活 <img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/88661/34/31941/855/63cf3e32F102a602f/622eec2bdd98379a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" />&mdash;&mdash;</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">新年新气象，好运好服务</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/181464/23/32233/316230/63cf3e46Fe9b7cefd/c01a20d9b699fa40.jpg\" /></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://getwuce.jdl.com/#/diyForm?formCode=BD3187402377390195328&amp;channelL1Code=l1-ch8&amp;channelCode=wucech87219\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/180672/33/32217/43354/63cf3e5fF4502eee3/9e76604b7ebdaed1.png\" /></a></p>", "contentAbstract": "新年愿望是一起把快递工作干下去！", "contentCode": "content01036", "contentTitle": "快递兄弟结伴春节值守：做快递就是做好服务", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1674525828000, "id": 2827, "isDelete": 0, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/3067/23/17256/250567/63cf3e7aFcc1eea9e/371dde9b9fc50192.png", "updateTime": 1674526343000}}